      "tips": [
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:0",
          "text": "Aim Volcanic Rupture so the pillar at the end of the fissure lands where the enemy wants to step. It zones them away from your minions.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-Q", "start": 4, "end": 20 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.08
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:1",
          "text": "Charge into a wall with Searing Charge when an enemy stands near it. The shockwave knocks them up.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-E", "start": 24, "end": 38 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.21
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:2",
          "text": "Use Searing Charge to break your own Volcanic Rupture pillar. You can also use it on pillars the enemy made, which opens a path or an escape.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-E", "start": 4, "end": 18 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-Q", "start": 37, "end": 53 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.02
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:3",
          "text": "Open a trade with Bellows Breath. It makes the enemy Brittle, so your next crowd control lasts longer and deals extra damage.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-W", "start": 18, "end": 32 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.33
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:4",
          "text": "Follow Bellows Breath with Searing Charge into a wall. The enemy is Brittle, so the knock up lasts longer and hits harder.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-W", "start": 7, "end": 21 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-E", "start": 27, "end": 41 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.75
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:5",
          "text": "Bellows Breath can't be stopped by crowd control once you start it. Use it to push through enemy crowd control, but you can't act until it ends.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-W", "start": 0, "end": 14 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.46
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:6",
          "text": "Hit an enemy with Volcanic Rupture to slow them. That makes it easier to land Bellows Breath or reach them with Searing Charge.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-Q", "start": 18, "end": 34 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "slowed", "start": 38, "end": 42 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-W", "start": 78, "end": 92 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-E", "start": 112, "end": 126 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.16
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:7",
          "text": "At level 6, cast Call of the Forge God, then recast to headbutt the elemental into enemies. It knocks them up, and with a team fight it can win the fight.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-R", "start": 17, "end": 38 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.38
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:general:8",
          "text": "Back off when the enemy attacks you while you forge. Damage from enemy champions or turrets interrupts it, so forge when you are safe.",
          "refs": [],
          "pWrong": 0.06
        }
      ],
      "combos": [
        {
          "id": "top:Ornn:combo:0",
          "name": "Double R headbutt",
          "category": "combo",
          "sequence": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-R" },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Ornn-R" }
          ],
          "when": "In teamfights, when you want the elemental to knock enemies up.",
          "whenRefs": [],
          "text": "Cast R, then recast to headbutt into the elemental as it arrives. This redirects it and makes it knock up the enemies it hits.",
          "textRefs": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
